<title>USA: Giant expects Q3 EPS to more than double.</title>
<headline>Giant expects Q3 EPS to more than double.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Giant Industries Inc said Thursday it expects to report earnings of between $0.45 and $0.49 per share in the third quarter ended September 30.</p>
<p>In the previous year's third quarter, the company recorded earnings of $0.17 per share.</p>
<p>It attributed the increase, in part, to strong margins and sales volumes at both the refining and retail levels.</p>
<p>Giant is a refiner and marketer of petroleum products.</p>
